    {
      "id": "7cee0ba8-9c34-47d0-b993-aa579d6bc563",
      "title": "Leia os exemplos, ouça o áudio e ligue a palavra a momentos com muitas demandas.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 11,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "2da53656-9627-4387-b3dd-5fdd20a590a0",
          "textContent": "<p>Use quando a pessoa tem muitas coisas ao mesmo tempo.</p>\n<p><strong>Estoy estresado.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Estoy estresada.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/952ae7a66ed1400fb9c1284cf86ee520_b11-estresado-use.mp3?Expires=1794099441&Signature=mUw6MV0Ui~6tS579IYqEUUVx-huQhsUN9pWQsMOvB519pNbdLv1ziMVQrTnPDW0~Ew4Mu02SiZZT0AzN4TBHimdJrg2SbS2bQl35UVZfgkk1eQkBfJNuK4rz3ridDeWARMjmdTmvKZ65P0z5g25mNqlN1B~~vaxzWYZ01qQ0xhywvIwsT0KNBBfOt30PI2oUtuUbJhpy30ieAKSd-6huHIQuF0MWwi7TivjBqeXQ6n6Z8CkHy9P5XdreLYxQXyTJKlNO~qYvcZQlXBP23lVtNCxcEGqkbXY70gop0~dQkgRc0XbynSu00BLizc3vBA9JeHMPgQbx2qDkilDvrRRR-Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
