    {
      "id": "9b54f710-67be-4624-ab12-c3d5d2907182",
      "title": "Leia os exemplos, ouça o áudio e ligue a palavra a um motivo de preocupação.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 13,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "94bd6201-4632-4955-bb6a-61ee4e9606cf",
          "textContent": "<p>Use quando algo deixa a pessoa preocupada naquele momento.</p>\n<p><strong>Estoy preocupado.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Estoy preocupada.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/31206954a6b74bcca8224caf528e7c43_b13-preocupado-use.mp3?Expires=1794099441&Signature=o9aDVEs27lXsXegGuMFrTCxqmqA0tTs6gtXiaiMvdtf461QpYAUVRZQu0mj1TqDMtGtgJ-gcBbfHWu6fxGegFv-ELwbqvOPq4~jawuHgnbj4y30DkNMP5vIPccwxH5c3CEetxeMwfnIbNEGUIwrnBwNLU3U6zDriF9XmDYKNt2WK~ZSEyDFkK7rD4Qo~FjmpeeMDPtrC0V9fmq83imZ~x7BSW4vLCTELTWc-NLb7vn4~AEC5Br8k0fzgFD8t3IqM7DR-3ClPIREZAWRKr9kzHiVjAfdlmycl7eJ0skDU3feHj5k5DbUBVe86g-RcvJnq2XapsrUGTRkHpSDNrV-2rQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
